ind":"announcement","title":"Ready for Next Fest!","summary":"We are complete with all 4 halves of updates for June Next Fest! We had to cut a couple of features but overall, we're satisfied! What's new? • Improved Sprite for Default Shotgun • Added in More Sandbox Menu Features, Including Change Gun's Sprite and SFX • Made GUI/UI Tweaks • Ironed Out Some Glitches • Added Captions • Added Multiple Language Support • Updated Game's Logo and Splash Screens • Improved Help Screen • Improved Default Physics for Shotgun and Sniper • Support for Linux and MAC Ol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T02:31:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928099","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4350340-1844115010487665","game_id":"steam-4350340","kind":"update","title":"Second-Half Update for Demo Coming Soon!","summary":"Replacing Shotgun with a new sprite!More updates: • Captions for hearing impaired • Multiple Language Support • More Tricks Recognized with Scoring • Physics Overhaul • Minor glitches and adjustmentsFinally... New Sandbox Menu addition, the ability to change gun's sprite into: • skateboard • Traffic Cone • Sword • U.S.A Football • Basketball • Different Gun Here's a sneak peak of a couple new guns for the full release! There will be 15 total guns in the full version, with variants having attachm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T22:55:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4350340-1842846814447547","game_id":"steam-4350340","kind":"update","title":"Shotgun Jumper Nano Update!","summary":"We included all four guns and customizable paintjobs in the demo for free. We also added in special graphical and technical additions like adding in actual bullets being projected out of guns when shooting, giving the Sandbox Menu its own dedicated key. adding in a dynamic camera, color adjustments to the main menus, made the development team logo splash screen skippable, fixed some glitches like empty bullet casings being stuck on terrain and more. Thank you for reading! Expect another update s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T18:51:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447547","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4350340-1840310314350142","game_id":"steam-4350340","kind":"update","title":"Upcoming Update to Demo for October's Next Fest","summary":"Welcome to Shotgun Jumper Nano! ːeaglegagːHello, Shotgun Jumpers; greetings from Double Rare World! Thanks for taking interest in our little micro video game, a completely original design by creative juggernaut Super Amauri! We'll be taking a moment to announce a very large upcoming FREE update for our demo, releasing this September-- we're preparing for Steam's October's Next Fest! Here's a little breakdown list of what to expect for the updated demo... Improved physics (no more JANK)Adding thr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T01:02:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314350142","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4350340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4350340":"2026-10-26T02:11:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":